## 1. Executive Summary

MedSync Health is committed to fostering a workplace where every individual feels valued, respected, and empowered to contribute their best work. This inaugural DEI Annual Report for Fiscal Year 2024 provides a transparent look at our current state, highlights our progress, and outlines our strategic focus areas for the coming year. As a global healthcare technology company, our mission to improve patient outcomes is intrinsically linked to the diversity of our teams, which drives innovation and better serves our diverse customer base.

As of Q4 2024, our global workforce stands at **1,200 employees** [1], reflecting a significant growth trajectory. While we have made strides in increasing representation across various dimensions, particularly in our global offices, we recognize that substantial work remains, especially in achieving gender parity in technical and leadership roles. Our focus for FY2025 will be on implementing targeted equity adjustments and enhancing inclusive leadership training.

